This project is an independent, unofficial Home Assistant integration.

Its Home Assistant integration layout was informed by the MIT-licensed
TomTuTHub/mitsubishi-outlander-phev-eu project. The Japanese authentication,
encryption, endpoint handling, data parsing, and safety behavior were written
for the Japanese Mitsubishi Motors service and are separate implementations.

Mitsubishi and related marks belong to their respective owners.
The integration brand images are derived from the official Mitsubishi Motors
iOS app icon and are used only to identify the compatible service.
